3. Third-party runtime dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Runtime dependencies (mcp, httpx, curl_cffi, pandas, tradingview-screener,
tradingview-ta, feedparser, requests, python-dateutil, vaderSentiment) are not
vendored; they are installed from PyPI under their own licenses. See each
project for details.

vaderSentiment (MIT, https://github.com/cjhutto/vaderSentiment) ships the
VADER sentiment lexicon used by tapebasis/sentiment.py for local,
token-free headline scoring. That module adds its own financial vocabulary on
top; the base lexicon and scoring algorithm are VADER's.

TradingView, Finviz, Yahoo Finance, StockAnalysis, Bloomberg and Marketaux are
